x360-native local patch 0002 for rexglue-sdk f5337cdc947ff6d4c4196737e2c807a48f2a1fc2 (v0.10.0)

Runtime::Setup: on failure, leave teardown to ~Runtime().

A failure after the graphics system was handed over (function table,
func_mappings, GPU setup) called Runtime::Shutdown() inside Setup, destroying
the graphics system and its D3D12 device while ReXApp still held an immediate
drawer, ImGui font texture and window presenter created from it.
ReXApp::OnDestroy then released those and crashed with an access violation in
D3D12Core (stack: ~D3D12ImmediateTexture <- ImGuiDrawer::SetImmediateDrawer <-
ReXApp::OnDestroy). Setup now returns the error and keeps the partly set-up
Runtime; its destructor runs Shutdown() after the owner released its objects,
the same order as a normal exit.

Test: tests/sdkcheck/setup_failure_test.cpp (sdkcheck.* in ctest).
No upstream equivalent at the time of writing.

diff --git a/src/system/runtime.cpp b/src/system/runtime.cpp
index c10694c..2778dd9 100644
--- a/src/system/runtime.cpp
+++ b/src/system/runtime.cpp
@@ -95,9 +95,14 @@ X_STATUS Runtime::Setup(RuntimeConfig config) {
   }
   instance_ = this;
 
-  auto fail = [this](X_STATUS status, std::string_view reason) {
+  // x360-native patch 0002 (patches/rexglue-sdk/0002-setup-failure-teardown.patch):
+  // a failed Setup does not tear the Runtime down. The caller may still hold
+  // objects made from what it handed over (ReXApp: immediate drawer, ImGui
+  // textures and window presenter from the graphics system), and must release
+  // them first; ~Runtime() runs Shutdown() afterwards, in the same order as a
+  // normal exit.
+  auto fail = [](X_STATUS status, std::string_view reason) {
     REXSYS_ERROR("Runtime::Setup failed: {}", reason);
-    Shutdown();
     return status;
   };
 
@@ -209,8 +214,7 @@ X_STATUS Runtime::Setup(const rex::PPCImageInfo& image_info, RuntimeConfig confi
                                                      image_info.image_base, image_info.image_size,
                                                      /*is_entrypoint=*/true)) {
     REXSYS_ERROR("Failed to initialize function table");
-    Shutdown();
-    return X_STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL;
+    return X_STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL;  // patch 0002: teardown is left to ~Runtime()
   }
 
   if (image_info.func_mappings) {
@@ -237,8 +241,7 @@ X_STATUS Runtime::Setup(const rex::PPCImageInfo& image_info, RuntimeConfig confi
                  duplicates, rejected);
     if (rejected > 0) {
       REXSYS_ERROR("PPCImageInfo registration: {} func_mappings entries rejected", rejected);
-      Shutdown();
-      return X_STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL;
+      return X_STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL;  // patch 0002: teardown is left to ~Runtime()
     }
   }
 
